# A legendary encounter, BATTLE_STATUS_LEGENDARY, which is its own cut-in
# and its own music, and the flag no other station sets.
#
# Level 20 rather than the 50 the game uses. At 50 the fight outlives the
# lead's first move and the run then sits on "There's no PP left for this
# move!" forever, which is a property of driving a battle with A alone rather
# than a defect. A station exists to end.

name FIGHTER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20006
money 24000
badge BADGE_ID_COAL
badge BADGE_ID_FOREST
badge BADGE_ID_COBBLE
badge BADGE_ID_FEN
party SPECIES_INFERNAPE 45 ITEM_NONE
# The lead's first move is set explicitly. A battle station is driven
# with A alone, which picks move slot 0 every turn, so a lead whose
# natural slot 0 is a status move never ends its fight, measured on a
# level 22 Monferno, which drew a level 5 Starly out past 40,000 frames.
party-move 0 0 MOVE_FLAMETHROWER
map MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_CITY 0x17B 0xEA FACE_DOWN
